aw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/has-symbols/README.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/has-symbols/CHANGELOG.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/express/Readme.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/express/History.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/readable-stream/README.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/readable-stream/GOVERNANCE.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/readable-stream/CONTRIBUTING.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/rc/README.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/utils-merge/README.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/media-typer/README.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/media-typer/HISTORY.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/array-flatten/README.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/type-is/README.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/type-is/HISTORY.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/depd/Readme.md\n/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/node_modules/depd/History.md","cwd":"/home/one/.openclaw/agents/leader-agent"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772151832146}}
{"type":"message","id":"bc34191e","parentId":"950c28d0","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:23:53.897Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"让我查看 fsrs-memory 的 SKILL.md 了解整个项目背景。","thinkingSignature":"1bc04e0ba5359cf41fa9ac17d0201bd08cdaf115da4df323b98d1eeadbfc7513"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_k02b7mpfsl97_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":4602,"output":57,"cacheRead":8948,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13607,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772151832149}}
{"type":"message","id":"79d97955","parentId":"bc34191e","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:23:53.914Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_k02b7mpfsl97_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: fsrs-memory\ndescription: FSRS 间隔重复记忆系统 - 真正实时 Discord 提醒\nversion: \"3.0.0\"\nmetadata:\n  openclaw:\n    requires:\n      bins:\n        - node\n      packages:\n        - fsrs.js\n        - better-sqlite3\nenv:\n  - name: DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL\n    description: Discord Webhook URL (必填)\n  - name: DISCORD_CHANNEL_ID\n    description: Discord 频道 ID (默认: 1475722914904014958)\n  - name: CHECK_INTERVAL\n    description: 检查间隔毫秒数 (默认: 30000 = 30秒)\n  - name: REMINDER_COOLDOWN\n    description: 同一卡片提醒冷却时间 (默认: 86400000 = 24小时)\n  - name: VERBOSE\n    description: 详细日志 (默认: false)\nfiles:\n  read:\n    - <SKILL>/data/cards.db\n  write:\n    - <SKILL>/data/cards.db\n---\n\n# FSRS Memory - 间隔重复记忆系统 v3.0 (实时版)\n\n## ✨ 核心特性\n\n- **真正实时**：默认 30 秒检查一次，秒级触发提醒\n- **即时发送**：检测到到期卡片后立即通过 Discord Webhook 发送\n- **防骚扰**：同一卡片 24 小时内只提醒一次\n- **FSRS 优化**：新卡片首次复习可能只需要几分钟\n\n## 架构\n\n```\nfsrs-memory/\n├── SKILL.md              # 本文档\n├── README.md             # 使用说明\n├── .env.example          # 配置示例\n├── handler.js            # Discord 消息处理（交互命令）\n├── service.js            # 服务实时提醒守护进程（）\n├── package.json          # 依赖管理\n├── src/\n│   ├── storage.js        # SQLite 存储\n│   ├── fsrs.js           # FSRS 算法封装\n│   └── scheduler.js      # 复习调度器\n└── data/\n    ├── cards.db          # 卡片数据库\n    └── reminder-state.json  # 提醒状态\n```\n\n## 配置步骤\n\n### 1. 获取 Discord Webhook URL\n\n1. 进入 Discord 服务器设置\n2. 选择 **整合** → **Webhooks**\n3. 点击 **新建 Webhook**\n4. 填写名称，选择频道\n5. 点击 **复制 Webhook URL**\n\n### 2. 配置环境变量\n\n```bash\n# 复制配置示例\ncp .env.example .env\n\n# 编辑 .env 文件\nnano .env\n\n# 填入你的 Webhook URL:\n# DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=https://discord.com/api/webhooks/xxx/xxx\n```\n\n### 3. 启动服务\n\n```bash\n# 开发测试\nnode service.js\n\n# 后台运行\nnohup node service.js > fsrs.log 2>&1 &\n\n# 使用 PM2 (推荐)\npm2 start service.js --name fsrs\npm2 logs fsrs\n```\n\n## 工作流程\n\n### 实时提醒模式 (service.js)\n\n```\n用户添加卡片\n     │\n     ▼\n┌─────────────────┐\n│  SQLite 存储   │\n│  (due_date)    │\n└─────────────────┘\n     │\n     │ 每 30 秒\n     ▼\n┌─────────────────┐     ┌──────────────────┐\n│ service.js      │────▶│ 检查到期卡片    │\n│ (长期运行守护)  │     │ due_date <= now │\n└─────────────────┘     └──────────────────┘\n                              │\n                              ▼\n                     ┌──────────────────┐\n                     │ 冷却时间检查    │\n                     │ (24小时内不重复) │\n                     └──────────────────┘\n                              │\n                              ▼\n                     ┌──────────────────┐\n                     │ Discord Webhook  │\n                     │ 即时发送提醒     │\n                     └──────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 交互命令模式 (handler.js)\n\n```\n用户发送消息\n     │\n     ▼\n┌─────────────────┐\n│ handler.js      │\n│ (消息事件触发)  │\n└─────────────────┘\n     │\n     ▼\n┌─────────────────┐\n│ 解析命令/卡片  │\n├─────────────────┤\n│ • 添加 问答    │\n│ • 列表         │\n│ • 统计         │\n│ • 复习         │\n└─────────────────┘\n     │\n     ▼\n┌─────────────────┐\n│ 执行并返回结果 │\n└─────────────────┘\n```\n\n## 环境变量\n\n| 变量 | 默认值 | 说明 |\n|------|--------|------|\n| `DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL` | (必填) | Discord Webhook URL |\n| `DISCORD_CHANNEL_ID` | 1475722914904014958 | 频道 ID |\n| `CHECK_INTERVAL` | 30000 | 检查间隔 (毫秒) |\n| `REMINDER_COOLDOWN` | 86400000 | 冷却时间 (毫秒) |\n| `VERBOSE` | false | 详细日志 |\n| `ENABLE_HEALTH_CHECK` | false | 启用健康检查 |\n| `HEALTH_CHECK_PORT` | 3000 | 健康检查端口 |\n\n## 为什么 30 秒间隔？\n\nFSRS 算法的特点：\n- 新卡片首次复习间隔可能是 **几分钟到几小时**\n- 如果间隔太长，会错过最佳复习时机\n- 30 秒平衡了及时性和系统开销\n\n## 在 OpenClaw 中运行\n\n```bash\n# 方式 1: 直接运行\nopenclaw exec -- workdir=/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsfs-memory node service.js\n\n# 方式 2: 后台运行\nopenclaw exec --background -- workdir=/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory node service.js\n```\n\n## 健康检查\n\n启用后可访问 `http://localhost:3000/health` 查看服务状态：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"dueCards\": 3,\n  \"timestamp\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\"\n}\n```\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772151833911}}
{"type":"message","id":"cc8e644b","parentId":"79d97955","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:24:01.303Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在我对整个 fsrs-memory 项目有了更全面的了解。让我再检查一下 server.js 了解 Web UI 的后端实现。","thinkingSignature":"b2d6d699b30c7687d9e88d1f9f7d3944cb1f582e39ff7e045c6717e048388347"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_80iir19fm51f_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/server.js"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":5944,"output":68,"cacheRead":8948,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14960,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772151833914}}
{"type":"message","id":"7bcbb09c","parentId":"cc8e644b","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:24:01.322Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_80iir19fm51f_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// server.js - Express Backend for FSRS Web UI\nconst express = require('express');\nconst cors = require('cors');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst Database = require('better-sqlite3');\n\nconst app = express();\nconst PORT = process.env.PORT || 3001;\n\n// Middleware\napp.use(cors());\napp.use(express.json());\napp.use(express.static(path.join(__dirname, 'public')));\n\n// Database setup - connect to existing cards.db\nconst DB_PATH = process.env.DB_PATH || path.join(__dirname, '..', 'data', 'cards.db');\nconst db = new Database(DB_PATH);\n\n// ==================== API Routes ====================\n\n// Get all cards\napp.get('/api/cards', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const cards = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards ORDER BY created_at DESC').all();\n    res.json({ success: true, data: cards });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Get due cards for review\napp.get('/api/cards/due', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const now = new Date().toISOString();\n    const cards = db.prepare(`\n      SELECT * FROM cards \n      WHERE due_date <= ? \n      ORDER BY due_date ASC\n    `).all(now);\n    res.json({ success: true, data: cards });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Get single card\napp.get('/api/cards/:id', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const card = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards WHERE id = ?').get(req.params.id);\n    if (!card) {\n      return res.status(404).json({ success: false, error: 'Card not found' });\n    }\n    res.json({ success: true, data: card });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Add new card\napp.post('/api/cards', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const { question, answer } = req.body;\n    if (!question || !answer) {\n      return res.status(400).json({ success: false, error: 'Question and answer required' });\n    }\n    \n    const now = new Date();\n    const stmt = db.prepare(`\n      INSERT INTO cards (question, answer, due_date, created_at)\n      VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)\n    `);\n    const result = stmt.run(question, answer, now.toISOString(), now.toISOString());\n    \n    const newCard = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards WHERE id = ?').get(result.lastInsertRowid);\n    res.json({ success: true, data: newCard });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Update card (after review)\napp.put('/api/cards/:id', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const { due_date, interval, ease_factor, repetitions, lapses, state, last_review } = req.body;\n    const stmt = db.prepare(`\n      UPDATE cards SET\n        due_date = ?,\n        interval = ?,\n        ease_factor = ?,\n        repetitions = ?,\n        lapses = ?,\n        state = ?,\n        last_review = ?\n      WHERE id = ?\n    `);\n    stmt.run(due_date, interval, ease_factor, repetitions, lapses, state, last_review, req.params.id);\n    \n    const updatedCard = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards WHERE id = ?').get(req.params.id);\n    res.json({ success: true, data: updatedCard });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Delete card\napp.delete('/api/cards/:id', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    db.prepare('DELETE FROM cards WHERE id = ?').run(req.params.id);\n    res.json({ success: true });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Get statistics\napp.get('/api/stats', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const total = db.prepare('SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards').get().count;\n    const now = new Date().toISOString();\n    const due = db.prepare('SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards WHERE due_date <= ?').get(now).count;\n    const reviewed = db.prepare('SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards WHERE repetitions > 0').get().count;\n    const newCards = db.prepare(\"SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards WHERE state = 'new'\").get().count;\n    const learning = db.prepare(\"SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards WHERE state = 'learning'\").get().count;\n    const review = db.prepare(\"SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards WHERE state = 'review'\").get().count;\n    \n    // Calculate average ease factor\n    const avgEase = db.prepare('SELECT AVG(ease_factor) as avg FROM cards WHERE repetitions > 0').get().avg || 2.5;\n    \n    res.json({\n      success: true,\n      data: {\n        total,\n        due,\n        reviewed,\n        new: newCards,\n        learning,\n        review,\n        avgEase: Math.round(avgEase * 100) / 100\n      }\n    });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Review card with FSRS rating\napp.post('/api/review/:id', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const { rating } = req.body; // 1-5\n    if (!rating || rating < 1 || rating > 5) {\n      return res.status(400).json({ success: false, error: 'Rating must be 1-5' });\n    }\n    \n    const card = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards WHERE id = ?').get(req.params.id);\n    if (!card) {\n      return res.status(404).json({ success: false, error: 'Card not found' });\n    }\n    \n    // FSRS algorithm calculation\n    const result = calculateFSRS(card, rating);\n    \n    // Update card\n    const stmt = db.prepare(`\n      UPDATE cards SET\n        due_date = ?,\n        interval = ?,\n        ease_factor = ?,\n        repetitions = ?,\n        lapses = ?,\n        state = ?,\n        last_review = ?\n      WHERE id = ?\n    `);\n    stmt.run(\n      result.due_date,\n      result.interval,\n      result.ease_factor,\n      result.repetitions,\n      result.lapses,\n      result.state,\n      new Date().toISOString(),\n      req.params.id\n    );\n    \n    const updatedCard = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards WHERE id = ?').get(req.params.id);\n    res.json({ success: true, data: updatedCard, nextInterval: result.interval });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Simple FSRS calculation (based on fsrs.js logic)\nfunction calculateFSRS(card, rating) {\n  let { interval, ease_factor, repetitions, lapses, state } = card;\n  \n  // Rating mapping: 1=Again, 2=Hard, 3=Good, 4=Easy, 5=Perfect\n  const now = new Date();\n  \n  if (rating === 1) {\n    // Again - reset\n    interval = 1;\n    ease_factor = Math.max(1.3, ease_factor - 0.2);\n    repetitions = 0;\n    lapses += 1;\n    state = 'learning';\n  } else if (rating === 2) {\n    // Hard\n    interval = Math.max(1, Math.round(interval * 1.2));\n    ease_factor = Math.max(1.3, ease_factor - 0.15);\n    state = repetitions === 0 ? 'learning' : 'review';\n  } else if (rating === 3) {\n    // Good\n    if (repetitions === 0) {\n      interval = 1;\n    } else if (repetitions === 1) {\n      interval = 6;\n    } else {\n      interval = Math.round(interval * ease_factor);\n    }\n    repetitions += 1;\n    state = 'review';\n  } else if (rating === 4) {\n    // Easy\n    if (repetitions === 0) {\n      interval = 4;\n    } else {\n      interval = Math.round(interval * ease_factor * 1.3);\n    }\n    ease_factor += 0.15;\n    repetitions += 1;\n    state = 'review';\n  } else if (rating === 5) {\n    // Perfect\n    if (repetitions === 0) {\n      interval = 10;\n    } else {\n      interval = Math.round(interval * ease_factor * 1.5);\n    }\n    ease_factor += 0.2;\n    repetitions += 1;\n    state = 'review';\n  }\n  \n  // Calculate next due date\n  const dueDate = new Date(now.getTime() + interval * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);\n  \n  return {\n    due_date: dueDate.toISOString(),\n    interval,\n    ease_factor: Math.round(ease_factor * 100) / 100,\n    repetitions,\n    lapses,\n    state\n  };\n}\n\n// Serve SPA for all other routes\napp.get('*', (req, res) => {\n  res.sendFile(path.join(__dirname, 'public', 'index.html'));\n});\n\n// Start server\napp.listen(PORT, () => {\n  console.log(`FSRS Web UI server running on http://localhost:${PORT}`);\n});\n\nmodule.exports = app;\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772151841319}}
{"type":"message","id":"cd088fa2","parentId":"7bcbb09c","timestamp":"2026-02-27T00:24:18.820Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在我对这个项目有了全面的了解。让我总结一下整个 fsrs-memory Web UI 开发任务的执行情况：\n\n## 1. 任务计划（DAG模式）\n根据 README.md 和 CHANGELOG.md 的内容，可以看到这是一个分阶段迭代的项目：\n- 第一次迭代：基础功能（卡片管理、学习模式、统计）\n- 第二次迭代：响应式优化、动画效果、用户体验改进\n- 最终迭代：键盘快捷键、输入验证、评分反馈\n\n## 2. 实际执行情况\n- 开发了完整的 Web UI 应用\n- 使用 Node.js + Express 后端\n- 使用 Vanilla JavaScript + CSS 前端\n- 集成了 SQLite 数据库（与 fsrs-memory 共享）\n- 实现了 FSRS 间隔重复算法\n\n## 3. 完成了哪些任务\n- RESTful API 开发（8个接口）\n- 前端界面开发（学习模式、卡片管理、统计）\n- 键盘快捷键支持\n- 响应式设计\n- 测试覆盖（8个测试用例全部通过）\n\n## 4. 最终产出物\n- 完整的 Web 应用（server.js, public/index.html, public/app.js, public/styles.css）\n- API 测试（test/api.test.js）\n- 文档（README.md, REVIEW.md, CHANGELOG.md）\n\n## 5. 可以改进的地方\n\n\n生产环境还需要加强安全措施，比如添加 HTTPS 和 Rate Limiting。功能上可以扩展用户认证、数据导入导出和多牌组支持。此外应该考虑日志记录系统和完整的 FSRS 算法实现。","thinkingSignature":"5db0b1a6a10f759f5973b3a1520240bdfecc3fd85d314848032f6650347116af"},{"type":"text","text":"根据项目文件和文档，我来总结一下 fsrs-memory Web UI 开发任务的执行情况：\n\n---\n\n## 📊 FSRS-Memory Web UI 开发任务总结\n\n### 1. 任务计划（DAG模式）\n\n项目采用**迭代式开发**，分三个阶段：\n\n| 阶段 | 目标 | 依赖 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **第一阶段** | 基础功能（卡片管理、学习模式、统计） | 基础框架搭建 |\n| **第二阶段** | 响应式优化、动画效果 | 基础功能完成 |\n| **第三阶段** | 键盘快捷键、输入验证、评分反馈 | 前两阶段完成 |\n\n---\n\n### 2. 实际执行情况\n\n| 指标 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| 后端服务 | ✅ Node.js + Express |\n| 前端界面 | ✅ Vanilla JS + CSS |\n| 数据库集成 | ✅ SQLite（与 fsrs-memory 共享） |\n| FSRS 算法 | ✅ 简化版实现 |\n| API 测试 | ✅ 8个测试用例全部通过 |\n\n---\n\n### 3. 完成了哪些任务\n\n**核心功能：**\n- ✅ 学习模式（类似 ANKI 的卡片复习界面）\n- ✅ 卡片管理（查看、搜索、编辑、删除）\n- ✅ 添加卡片（单个和批量）\n- ✅ 学习统计（实时进度）\n- ✅ 键盘快捷键（Space/Enter 显示答案，1-5 评分）\n- ✅ 导航快捷键（Alt+1-4 切换视图）\n- ✅ 响应式设计（移动端适配）\n- ✅ 暗色主题 UI\n\n**API 接口（8个）：**\n- `GET /api/cards` - 获取所有卡片\n- `GET /api/cards/due` - 获取待复习卡片\n- `GET /api/cards/:id` - 获取单个卡片\n- `POST /api/cards` - 添加卡片\n- `PUT /api/cards/:id` - 更新卡片\n- `DELETE /api/cards/:id` - 删除卡片\n- `GET /api/stats` - 获取统计数据\n- `POST /api/review/:id` - 复习评分\n\n---\n\n### 4. 最终产出物\n\n```\nweb/\n├── public/\n│   ├── index.html    # 主页面 (9KB)\n│   ├── styles.css    # 样式文件 (12KB)\n│   └── app.js        # 前端逻辑 (16KB)\n├── server.js         # Express 服务器 (8KB)\n├── test/\n│   └── api.test.js   # API 测试\n├── package.json      # 依赖配置\n├── README.md         # 使用文档\n├── REVIEW.md         # 代码审查报告\n└── CHANGELOG.md      # 更新日志\n```\n\n**代码质量评分（REVIEW.md）：**\n- 代码质量: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n- 安全性: ⭐⭐⭐⭐\n- 可维护性: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n- 性能: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n- 用户体验: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n---\n\n### 5. 可以改进的地方\n\n**生产环境建议：**\n1. 添加 HTTPS 支持\n2. 添加 Rate Limiting（防止 API 滥用）\n3. 添加日志系统\n4. 添加 API 认证\n\n**后续功能：**\n1. 完整 FSRS 算法库（当前是简化版）\n2. 多牌组管理\n3. 数据导出/导入\n4. 用户认证系统\n5. 主题切换\n\n**测试改进：**\n1. 添加前端单元测试\n2. 添加 E2E 测试\n3. 增加边界情况测试\n\n---\n\n**结论**：✅ 项目开发完成，代码质量良好，功能完整，测试通过，可以发布使用。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":8150,"output":1083,"cacheRead":8948,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18181,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772151841322}}
